{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>\n{\n  \"mechs\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"这一刻已经让他很在乎，却没有过去的经验能保证什么。正因为珍惜眼前正在发生的事，时间不断过去本身就让他不安。\",\n      \"premise\": \"无\",\n      \"members\": [\"c1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"过去的好时刻或熟悉的亲切仍能打动他，让他感到温暖和珍惜；但他不知道它们如今是否仍能真正亲近、是否还属于现在，还是只能留在回忆里。因此，期待与茫然、失落和不踏实同时存在。\",\n      \"premise\": \"无\",\n      \"members\": [\"c2\", \"c3\", \"c4\", \"c9\", \"c12\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他隐约想与某个人亲近，却不知道对方如今离自己多远，也不知道两人的心意能否相通。亲切和向往是真的，无法确认对方是否同样在意也是真的，所以不能安心。\",\n      \"premise\": \"无\",\n      \"members\": [\"c5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他已经觉得眼前这一刻很重要，不愿随便度过，却还不知道自己与它是什么关系、该怎样认真面对，也不确定自己能否全心留在其中。如果心里牵挂着某个人，也无法确定对方是否同样在意，因此既期待又不踏实，想靠近却又退缩。\",\n      \"premise\": \"无\",\n      \"members\": [\"c6\", \"c8\", \"c13\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他仍感到与那个人的亲近，但这份亲近像是从过去回来的。温暖来自它还没有消失，惆怅则来自他不知道如今这份亲近是否仍属于两个人。\",\n      \"premise\": \"无\",\n      \"members\": [\"c7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"过去留下的亲近仍能切实影响现在，却无法完整地重新成为眼前可以拥有的幸福。因此，即使还感到温暖、还想接近它，靠近的同时也会感到失去。\",\n      \"premise\": \"无\",\n      \"members\": [\"c10\", \"c11\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他被某种尚未说清的意义吸引，心里仍有期待；但奇怪的是，明明还在靠近，就已经觉得有些东西无法原样回来。因此，期待还未消失，怅然却已经出现。\",\n      \"premise\": \"无\",\n      \"members\": [\"c14\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0dd8d9f9-3cfb-43c5-9d5e-3160d446ed73", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T053503558860Z", "elapsed_seconds": 147.75, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T05:37:31.311937+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "28a7fefdf540b03cbd4aa1cfeee7fa97f5392aac0ca80e0f3c2381aa9da515f7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T053503558860Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "856b3baedf605f69ebecc983b5533d06721555c2239107b6a564f4116b92fabe"}}}
